(KESTREL VALLEY WATER - CUSTOMER SERVICE STANDARDS) Tj T*
(Edition 2019. Published March 2019.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1 About these standards) Tj T*
(This document sets out the service that Kestrel Valley Water gives to its customers in the) Tj T*
(Kestrel Valley supply area. It replaces the standards published in 2015. The standards apply to) Tj T*
(residential and business customers alike unless a section says otherwise.) Tj T*
(Kestrel Valley Water supplies drinking water to about 210,000 households and 9,000 businesses) Tj T*
(through 3,400 kilometres of mains.) Tj T*
(Page 1) Tj T*
ET
