(KESTREL VALLEY WATER - CUSTOMER SERVICE STANDARDS) Tj T*
(Edition 2019. Published March 2019.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 Leaks and supply problems) Tj T*
(We SHALL attend reported leaks within 4 hours of the first report, day or night.) Tj T*
(Customers are given at least 48 hours notice of a service interruption for planned work on the) Tj T*
(mains.) Tj T*
(If an unplanned interruption lasts longer than 12 hours, we deliver bottled water to customers) Tj T*
(who ask for it.) Tj T*
(The emergency helpline answers calls within 2 minutes on average.) Tj T*
(Page 2) Tj T*
ET
