(3 Meters and bills) Tj T*
(Meters are read every 6 months. Customers may also send their own reading through the website.) Tj T*
(Bills are issued twice a year, after each meter reading.) Tj T*
(The reconnection fee is GBP 45 when a supply has been disconnected at the customer's request.) Tj T*
(Customers who pay by direct debit may spread the cost over 10 monthly payments.) Tj T*
(Page 3) Tj T*
